1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
In Gurdjieff's cosmology, life forms
Earth's sensitive membrane.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:08,100
Planetary influences pass through
living things toward Earth.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,200
Yet life also radiates outward.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:16,000
The Sun, planets, and Moon receive different
kinds of influences from this living world.
